'install_59'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>Aktivasi akun</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            Aktivasi akun\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            {%username%},<br><br>Pesan ini dikirim dari situs {$url}<br><br>Anda menerima email ini karena alamat email ini digunakan saat registrasi di situs. Jika Anda tidak mendaftar di situs ini, abaikan email ini dan hapus saja. Anda tidak akan menerima email seperti ini lagi.<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>Login dan kata sandi Anda di situs:<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>Login: {%username%}<br>Kata sandi: {%password%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>Petunjuk aktivasi<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>Terima kasih telah mendaftar. Kami meminta Anda mengonfirmasi registrasi Anda untuk memastikan bahwa alamat email yang Anda masukkan benar-benar valid. Ini diperlukan untuk melindungi dari penyalahgunaan yang tidak diinginkan dan spam.<br><br>Untuk mengaktifkan akun Anda, buka tautan berikut:<br><br><a href=\"{%validationlink%}\" target=\"_blank\">{%validationlink%}</a><br><br>Jika langkah-langkah tersebut juga tidak berhasil, mungkin akun Anda telah dihapus. Dalam hal ini, hubungi Administrator untuk menyelesaikan masalah ini.<br><br>Hormat kami,<br>Administrasi {$url}.\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_60'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>{%subject%}</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            {%subject%}\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            {%username_to%},<br><br>Pesan ini dikirim kepada Anda oleh {%username_from%} dari situs {$url}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>Teks pesan<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>{%text%}<br><br>IP pengirim: {%ip%}<br>Grup: {%group%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>Harap diingat bahwa administrasi situs tidak bertanggung jawab atas isi pesan ini<br><br>Hormat kami,<br>Administrasi {$url}\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_61'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>Pemulihan kata sandi yang terlupa</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            Pemulihan kata sandi yang terlupa\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            Pengguna yang terhormat {%username%},<br><br>Anda meminta pemulihan kata sandi di situs {$url}. Namun demi keamanan, semua kata sandi disimpan dalam bentuk terenkripsi sehingga kami tidak dapat memberitahukan kata sandi lama Anda. Jika Anda ingin membuat kata sandi baru, buka tautan berikut:<br><br>{%lostlink%}<br><br>Jika Anda tidak meminta pemulihan kata sandi, cukup hapus email ini. Kata sandi Anda disimpan dengan aman dan tidak dapat diakses oleh pihak lain.<br><br>IP pengirim: {%ip%}<br><br>Hormat kami,<br>Administrasi {$url}<br>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_62'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>Pemberitahuan penambahan publikasi di situs</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            Pemberitahuan penambahan publikasi di situs\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            Administrator yang terhormat,<br><br>kami memberitahukan bahwa sebuah berita telah ditambahkan ke situs {$url} dan saat ini sedang menunggu moderasi.<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>Informasi singkat tentang berita<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>Penulis: {%username%}<br>Judul berita: {%title%}<br>Kategori: {%category%}<br>Tanggal penambahan: {%date%}<br><br>Hormat kami,<br>Administrasi {$url}\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_63'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>Pemberitahuan penambahan komentar di situs</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            Pemberitahuan penambahan komentar di situs\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            Pengguna yang terhormat {%username_to%},<br><br>kami memberitahukan bahwa sebuah komentar telah ditambahkan di situs {$url} pada berita yang Anda ikuti.<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>Informasi singkat tentang komentar<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>Penulis: {%username%}<br>Tanggal penambahan: {%date%}<br>Tautan ke berita: {%link%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>Teks komentar<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>{%text%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>Jika Anda tidak ingin lagi menerima pemberitahuan tentang komentar baru untuk berita ini, silakan buka tautan berikut: <a href=\"{%unsubscribe%}\" target=\"_blank\">{%unsubscribe%}</a><br><br>Hormat kami,<br>Administrasi {$url}\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
