51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            Pemberitahuan penerimaan pesan pribadi di situs\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            Pengguna yang terhormat {%username%},<br><br>kami memberitahukan bahwa sebuah pesan pribadi telah dikirim kepada Anda di situs {$url}.<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>Informasi singkat tentang pesan<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>Pengirim: {%fromusername%}<br>Tanggal diterima: {%date%}<br>Judul: {%title%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>Teks pesan<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>{%text%}<br><br>Hormat kami,<br>Administrasi {$url}\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_65'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>Pemberitahuan pengaitan jejaring sosial ke akun</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            Pemberitahuan pengaitan jejaring sosial ke akun\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            Pengguna yang terhormat {%username%},<br><br>Anda telah mengajukan permintaan untuk menggabungkan akun Anda di situs {$url} dengan akun di jejaring sosial {%network%}. Namun demi keamanan, Anda perlu mengonfirmasi tindakan ini melalui tautan berikut:<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br><a href=\"{%link%}\" target=\"_blank\">{%link%}</a><br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>Jika Anda tidak membuat permintaan ini, cukup hapus email ini. Data akun Anda disimpan dengan aman dan tidak dapat diakses oleh pihak lain.<br><br>IP pengirim: {%ip%}<br><br>Hormat kami,<br>Administrasi {$url}\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_66'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>{%title%}</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,body{\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }     \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration:none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            {%title%}\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            {%content%}\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_67'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n  <title>Otorisasi dua faktor</title>\r\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n    html,\r\n    body {\r\n      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n      line-height: 1.5;\r\n      font-size: 14px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    p {\r\n      margin-top: 0;\r\n      margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    p:last-child {\r\n      margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    a:active,\r\n    a:visited,\r\n    a:link {\r\n      color: #4C6891;\r\n      text-decoration: none;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    a:hover {\r\n      color: #4C6891;\r\n      text-decoration: underline;\r\n    }\r\n  </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n              Otorisasi dua faktor\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n{%username%},<br><br>Pesan ini dikirim dari situs {$url}<br><br>Anda menerima email ini karena otorisasi dua faktor telah diaktifkan untuk akun Anda. Untuk masuk ke situs, Anda harus memasukkan kode PIN yang Anda terima.<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>Kode PIN:<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>{%pin%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>Jika Anda tidak melakukan otorisasi di situs kami, berarti kata sandi Anda diketahui pihak lain. Anda harus segera masuk ke situs dengan login dan kata sandi Anda, lalu mengubah kata sandi di profil Anda.<br><br>IP pengguna yang memasukkan kata sandi: {%ip%}<br><br>Hormat kami,<br>Administrasi {$url}\r\n           </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n        </table>\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",

